  "ruleText": "Puc 1604.06 Filing Requirement. As part of a filing for a full rate case, a utility shall complete and submit to the commission the Filing Requirement Schedules, which are set forth in detail in Puc 1604.07.\n\nSource. #6573, eff 9-10-97; ss #8428, eff 9-10-05; ss by #10535, eff 3-4-14; ss by #14030, eff 7-25-24",
